      549.3595581054688,
      133.20208740234375
    ],
    "math": false,
    "text": "This chapter explains the finite algebraic core and its verification gates. For the combined core and\nanalytic continuation, use the opening chapter and formal/README.md. The finite namespace counts in\nthe excerpts apply only to that finite baseline.\n"
  },
  {
    "block": 2,
