      62.30099868774414,
      379.114990234375,
      549.371337890625,
      447.47210693359375
    ],
    "math": false,
    "text": "The authoritative scripts/verify_theorem_map.py checks the map row sequence, uniqueness, compiled\ndeclaration kinds, manuscript status annotations, inherited references, and explicit audit coverage. In\nthe pinned compiled environment, it distinguishes the 88 theorem targets from the 55 construction\ntargets. A lexical scan can locate these declarations in source, but does not independently elaborate\ntheir types.\n"
  },
  {
