    "bbox": [
      62.63999938964844,
      453.41497802734375,
      549.3597412109375,
      493.0491027832031
    ],
    "math": false,
    "text": "The kernel audit file asks Lean to print transitive axioms for all mapped targets. It then inspects\nthe compiled Komorebi.PaperIII namespace, including generated declarations and implementation\nauxiliaries. This second step protects the boundary beyond just the manually listed names.\n"
